---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/ITserviceLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
      <LinkBox />
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>PROFESSIONAL SERVICES</h3>
        <p>
          As a specialist in professional IT solutions, BIM offers a host of
          solution integration services that are flexible, agile, secure and
          cost effective. These are delivered following our 3DM service
          methodology:
        </p>
        <p>Discover, Design, Deploy and Manage.</p>
        <p>Our world-class professional services portfolio includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Application Networking Services</li>
          <li>Borderless Networks</li>
          <li>Collaboration Architecture</li>
          <li>Contact Center Express</li>
          <li>Data Center Architecture</li>
          <li>Optical Networking</li>
          <li>Security</li>
          <li>Service Provider</li>
          <li>Storage Area Networking</li>
          <li>Wireless</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Our highly skilled and qualified professional services team, featuring
          a high proportion of engineering and technical staff, helps customers
          to understand the current state of their business communications
          systems and ensures alignment with their business objectives.
        </p>
        <p>
          Talk to us and let us help in visualizing your future communication
          systems and roadmap, identifying ROI in productivity gains and
          reducing your costs.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS PROFESSIONAL SERVICES?
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/technology.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
